language sdl-mvp1-exercise version 0.1.

capability TaperPrediction.
functionality FitTaperNor.
functionality FitMixedKozak.
functionality ProjectWorkingProfile.

TaperModels cites "https://github.com/Hans-Einar/ponsse/blob/7589a5811a21ec6bb13979612060ceff0f690df8/MVP1/packages/taper-models/SDP/03--Requirements/requirements.md".
TaperModels provides TaperPrediction.
TaperModels owns FitTaperNor.
FitTaperNor realizes TaperPrediction.
FitTaperNor specifies "Pure deterministic taperNOR for supported species; preserve minimum height/sample/span gates and version identity.".
TaperModels owns FitMixedKozak.
FitMixedKozak realizes TaperPrediction.
FitMixedKozak specifies "Pure Mixed Kozak97 spruce model preserving evidence limitations; no invented unsupported prediction.".
TaperModels owns ProjectWorkingProfile.
ProjectWorkingProfile realizes TaperPrediction.
ProjectWorkingProfile specifies "Use absolute measurement history and an explicit working root; preserve model/provenance and unavailable/fallback results.".
